; [0.8.1-RT18] (#968), work #969: ATTDISP OFF from Normal: $ATTMODE 0, "Regenerating
; model." (autocad-attdisp-off.txt, Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit
; 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736, CC0-1.0), no undo step, the drawing is
; modified (card PT18, point 2; docs/adr/0056, point 5; card PT27, point 2).
; Source: Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736
; (CC0-1.0): autocad-attsync.dxf, .scr and .txt (AutoCAD 2021, Italian; the prompts
; are translated as docs/adr/0056, point 5, and card PT18).
; sincro.dxf is handwritten, with the header and tables of textedit/attributi
; ($HANDSEED 1000, no DIMSTYLE table): the state of autocad-attsync.dxf after the two
; -BLOCK redefinitions and before ATTSYNC, taken from SINCRO_B, which ATTSYNC left alone.
; - SINCRO_A (record 90, BLOCK B6) and SINCRO_B (record 9B, BLOCK C2), base 0,0, as
;   in autocad-attsync.dxf: a 40x20 LWPOLYLINE (B7, C3), a CIRCLE at 35,5 radius 3
;   (B8, C4), then the ATTDEFs QUARTO (prompt Quarto, default Q0) at 2,5 height 2.5
;   (B9, C5), TERZO (Terzo, T0) at 22,15 height 3.5 (BA, C6) and PRIMO (Primo, P0) at
;   2,15 height 2.5 (BB, C7), in this order;
; - TELAIO (record D0, BLOCK D1): a 30x10 LWPOLYLINE D2, no attributes, not inserted;
; - in the drawing, with the ATTRIBs of the first definition (TERZO at 2,5, SECONDO at
;   2,10, PRIMO at 2,15, height 2.5, moved by the insertion point), as SINCRO_B in
;   autocad-attsync.dxf: INSERT A2 of SINCRO_A at 0,-40 with A4 TERZO "A1-3",
;   A5 SECONDO "A1-2", A6 PRIMO "A1-1" and SEQEND A3; INSERT A7 of SINCRO_A at 60,-40
;   with A9 "A2-3", AA "A2-2", AB "A2-1" and SEQEND A8; INSERT AC of SINCRO_B at
;   120,-40 with AE "B-3", AF "B-2", B0 "B-1" and SEQEND AD.
; The ATTRIBs read from the file have alignment-point 0,0 (no group 11, as AutoCAD
; writes a left-aligned text; dxf-blocchi/attributi-extra-seqend).
; ~box: LiberationSans-Regular.ttf of resources/fonts, read with a small reader of its
; OS/2, cmap and hmtx tables: cap height 1409, ascent 1854, descent -434, summed
; advances; an ATTDEF shows its tag, an ATTRIB its value.
; The report after OPEN (drawing, dimension styles of a file without DIMSTYLE, blocks
; with units=4 from the record, documents) follows textedit/attributi.
OPEN
sincro.dxf
ATTDISP
OFF
